Short:        ULTIMATE Amiga Address Book (XMas Edition)
Author:       fosters@dvalley.demon.co.uk (Tom Bampton)
Uploader:     fosters dvalley demon co uk (Tom Bampton)
Type:         biz/dbase
Version:      4.2 Release
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

MegaBook is a fast and very easy to use address book program. Dont let it's
ease of use fool you, its powerfull enough to handle all your address book
needs. 

If you're looking for a fast, easy, address book ... look no further!

 "As address books for the Amiga go, MegaBook is about the best there is."
   ... Amiga Format, Nov. 1998

MegaBook 4.2 is the start of some major updates in MegaBook. The Install
directory has been completely reorganised, space wasted before has now been
retaken. The Installer has been rewritten, and an Upgrade script is now
available for previous users. The Extras system has also been rewritten,
allowing a lot more flexibility then before ... you can now use multiple
scripts for one Extra! We have also finally included the ASCII MBIO so you
can export text files. There is a lot more new stuff in this release ...
check it out, you will be pleasantly surprised!

Happy Christmas to all our users!!

Quick (slightly out of date) feature list:

 o Multiple projects open at once
 o Selectable fields
 o Store notes on any record
 o Country field now (finally) added
 o Voice dial your fone
 o Data dial your modem using your favourite terminal program
 o Send EMails
 o Send faxes
 o Go to URLs
 o Supports external loaders/savers so you can use almost any file format
 o Loads and saves compressed files
 o Full ARexx support
 o ARexx Macro Recorder
 o Free memory is your only size limit
 o Print address labels (using an ARexx script)
 o Optional MagicWB style toolbar
 o Silly lottery and fortune cookies
 o You can now change the font MegaBook uses.
 o Doesnt use MUI (yes, thats a feature ;)..)
 o 100% totally FREE

There's much more then this too, download it and you'll be pleasantly
surprised!
